00:26:11,946 --> 00:26:14,949
I haven 't read more than two books in my whole life .

281
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:19,996
One , never finished ,

282
00:26:22,748 --> 00:26:25,334
and the other 's the phone book .

283
00:26:45,062 --> 00:26:47,857
I don 't want her to become a Returner .

284
00:26:47,857 --> 00:26:50,359
I don 't want to see her again .

285
00:27:16,677 --> 00:27:18,220
No !

286
00:27:18,220 --> 00:27:19,472
Yes , my love .

287
00:27:21,223 --> 00:27:22,808
