288
00:27:22,808 --> 00:27:25,561
But you do it so well , so well .

289
00:27:27,104 --> 00:27:28,522
Not to you .

290
00:27:28,522 --> 00:27:32,610
It will be better with me than with the others .

291
00:28:19,407 --> 00:28:20,741
Nyah !

292
00:28:28,916 --> 00:28:29,917
You do it !

293
00:28:31,460 --> 00:28:32,837
Well go on !

294
00:28:32,837 --> 00:28:35,631
If you finish fast , I 'll buy you an ice cream .

295
00:28:35,631 --> 00:28:40,636
Nyah .

296
00:28:46,100 --> 00:28:48,436
Here comes the Unforgiven !

297
00:28:50,354 --> 00:28:54,108
The man whose micro-dick 's so small he pees with tweezers !

298
00:28:54,108 --> 00:28:55,317
Tweezers ?

299
00:28:55,317 --> 00:28:57,194
That 's a good one . - Way to go !

300
00:28:57,194 --> 00:28:58,320
He could become a woman .

301
00:28:58,320 --> 00:28:59,196
That would solve it !

302
00:28:59,196 --> 00:29:01,532
What is it that you hear about them sewing them back on ?

303
00:29:01,532 --> 00:29:03,492
Yeah , they can stitch them right on ,

304
00:29:03,492 --> 00:29:05,119
if of course you don 't have one to start with .

305
00:29:05,119 --> 00:29:07,455
Forget it , I started that rumor .

306
00:29:07,455 --> 00:29:09,373
The more they laugh , the further away they seem .

307
00:29:09,373 --> 00:29:11,542
You can never be too different , Gnaghi .

308
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,962
Maybe you can .

309
00:29:14,962 --> 00:29:17,548
Engineer !

310
00:29:17,548 --> 00:29:19,425
Engineer , Engineer !

311
00:29:19,425 --> 00:29:21,969
Come , have a seat .

312
00:29:21,969 --> 00:29:23,471
Well , well , well .

313
00:29:23,512 --> 00:29:24,555
What a surprise .

314
00:29:24,555 --> 00:29:28,184
Yes , it 's a miracle seeing you here .

315
00:29:28,184 --> 00:29:31,187
It 's a miracle seeing you here , Mr. Mayor .

316
00:29:31,187 --> 00:29:35,149
So , how are things , down at our cemetery ?

317
00:29:35,149 --> 00:29:36,275
How are things ?

318
00:29:36,275 --> 00:29:37,818
Well , how do you think things are ?

319
00:29:37,818 --> 00:29:39,361
Population 's shrinking isn 't it ?

320
00:29:39,361 --> 00:29:40,196
By leaps and bounds .

321
00:29:40,196 --> 00:29:42,698
Hey , you 're lucky , my dear engineer .

322
00:29:42,698 --> 00:29:45,951
You just can 't imagine how things are at the town hall .

323
00:29:45,951 --> 00:29:47,244
Now that the elections are upon us .

324
00:29:47,244 --> 00:29:49,038
It is chaos !

325
00:29:49,038 --> 00:29:51,248
Right , Inspector ? - Yeah , it 's a free for all .

326
00:29:51,248 --> 00:29:53,209
Nobody wants to lose their job !

327
00:29:53,209 --> 00:29:55,377
According to a new deal -

328
00:29:55,377 --> 00:29:57,880
Daddy , what 's this ?

329
00:29:57,880 --> 00:30:00,049
