337
00:30:19,610 --> 00:30:20,444
Oh yes , of course .

338
00:30:20,444 --> 00:30:22,029
Sometimes Gnaghi gets a bit excited .

339
00:30:22,029 --> 00:30:22,863
Oh , I 'm sure .

340
00:30:22,863 --> 00:30:23,697
