Now where was I ?

342
00:30:24,949 --> 00:30:26,075
Oh , yes , just the same .

343
00:30:26,075 --> 00:30:27,493
- I see . - Precisely .

344
00:30:27,493 --> 00:30:30,412
By keeping things the same we can change more effectively .

345
00:30:31,247 --> 00:30:32,748
What 's it doing ?

346
00:30:32,748 --> 00:30:33,624
Dancing ?

347
00:30:33,624 --> 00:30:35,709
No , no , he 's about to -

348
00:30:40,005 --> 00:30:41,549
