360
00:31:18,085 --> 00:31:19,420
Just get in the car !

361
00:31:19,420 --> 00:31:20,629
It 's not the end of the world .

362
00:31:20,629 --> 00:31:22,965
It didn 't even bother her !

363
00:31:22,965 --> 00:31:24,133
She understood it was just

364
00:31:24,133 --> 00:31:25,551
