367
00:31:28,304 --> 00:31:29,138
Nyah !

368
00:31:32,516 --> 00:31:34,101
Come on , Gnaghi , get in !

369
00:31:36,562 --> 00:31:39,189
Look , first love doesn 't count .

370
00:31:39,189 --> 00:31:40,858
It 's last love that counts .

371
00:31:46,155 --> 00:31:46,989
Oh .

372
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:52,036
Nobody came today .

373
00:31:52,036 --> 00:31:53,621
I was a bit bored .

374
00:31:53,662 --> 00:31:55,414
Not even the admiral .

375
00:31:55,414 --> 00:31:57,333
He 's just disappeared !

376
00:31:57,333 --> 00:32:00,794
Let 's hope tomorrow .

377
00:32:00,794 --> 00:32:02,379
Come again and stay awhile .

378
00:32:02,379 --> 00:32:06,091
Oh , he was such a distinguished looking man !

379
00:32:06,091 --> 00:32:11,096
The Admiral , always used to bring me , always a touch of Sambuca !

380
00:32:47,299 --> 00:32:48,926
Oh , come on , Gnaghi !

381
00:32:49,760 --> 00:32:51,303
You 'll get over it , you 'll see .

382
00:32:54,473 --> 00:32:57,434
Time passes , nothing seems the same .

383
00:33:02,064 --> 00:33:04,066
It just gets worse !

384
00:33:04,066 --> 00:33:06,944
God , is it ever difficult trying to make you feel better !

385
00:33:09,947 --> 00:33:12,449
What were you doing with the Mayor 's daughter anyway ?

386
00:33:12,449 --> 00:33:13,575
She 's only a child !

387
00:33:13,575 --> 00:33:14,410
Nyah !

388
00:33:17,621 --> 00:33:18,664
Oh yeah !

389
00:33:18,664 --> 00:33:19,665
That is not true .

390
00:33:19,665 --> 00:33:20,582
You 're not a child , Gnaghi .

391
00:33:20,582 --> 00:33:22,418
