413
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:50,464
Slaughter of the innocents !

414
00:34:50,464 --> 00:34:52,132
And they were all so young .

415
00:34:52,132 --> 00:34:53,383
Right !

416
00:34:53,383 --> 00:34:54,593
They thought their life was ahead of them ,

417
00:34:54,593 --> 00:34:56,053
