418
00:34:56,053 --> 00:34:58,889
Well , you 've got your hands full .

419
00:34:58,889 --> 00:34:59,723
Oh !

420
00:34:59,723 --> 00:35:00,849
More than you know .

421
00:35:00,849 --> 00:35:05,145
Gnaghi , we 're going to need a lot of bullets .

422
00:35:05,145 --> 00:35:08,732
? Now I do my scouting in a marble tomb ?

423
00:35:08,732 --> 00:35:12,069
? Never should 've gone out on the Boy Scout picnic ?

424
00:35:12,069 --> 00:35:15,572
? Never should 've never should 've gone just then ?

425
00:35:15,572 --> 00:35:18,951
? Never should 've gone out on the Boy Scout picnic ?

426
00:35:18,951 --> 00:35:20,160
? Never should 've ?

427
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:22,538
? Now I 'll never go again ?

428
00:35:22,538 --> 00:35:23,372
Oh , Claudio !

429
00:35:23,372 --> 00:35:24,832
Take me with you !

430
00:35:24,832 --> 00:35:26,959
Don 't leave me all alone !

431
00:35:26,959 --> 00:35:28,001
Claudio !

432
00:35:28,001 --> 00:35:30,546
Take me with you , my love !

433
00:35:30,546 --> 00:35:32,381
Oh , no sweetheart ,

434
00:35:32,381 --> 00:35:34,925
my son wasn 't with you !

435
00:35:34,925 --> 00:35:37,302
He was promised to the Mayor 's daughter !

436
00:35:37,302 --> 00:35:38,637
But he loved me !

437
00:35:38,637 --> 00:35:41,348
- Liar ! - He was mine .

438
00:35:41,348 --> 00:35:43,267
He loved me , only me !

439
00:35:43,267 --> 00:35:45,853
Have you no respect for a mother ?

440
00:35:45,853 --> 00:35:47,521
We 're born to die .

441
00:35:48,939 --> 00:35:50,065
Born merely to die !

442
00:35:50,065 --> 00:35:51,733
Do you remember ?

443
00:35:53,068 --> 00:35:57,114
Just yesterday , she was alive , happy .

444
00:35:57,114 --> 00:35:58,115
Do you remember ?

445
00:35:59,283 --> 00:36:03,495
Dear Gnaghi even threw up on her and she took it so well !

446
00:36:04,496 --> 00:36:07,666
And now , she 's gone .

447
00:36:07,666 --> 00:36:10,460
And right on the eve of the elections !

448
00:36:10,460 --> 00:36:12,462
I 'd better get the pickax and shovel .

449
00:36:13,380 --> 00:36:16,925
Pumpkin , how could you do this to me ?

450
00:36:47,581 --> 00:36:49,499
Is it true what they say ,

451
00:36:49,499 --> 00:36:51,543
