452
00:36:51,543 --> 00:36:52,377
Tell me !

453
00:36:52,377 --> 00:36:53,170
Okay !

454
00:36:53,170 --> 00:36:54,046
Who told you that ?

455
00:36:54,046 --> 00:36:55,881
Is it true or not ?

456
00:36:55,881 --> 00:36:56,840
Shhh .

457
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:58,008
What if it is ?

458
00:36:58,008 --> 00:37:00,677
I 've got to see Claudio again !

459
00:37:00,677 --> 00:37:03,138
I have to know whether he loved me or her .

460
00:37:03,138 --> 00:37:05,140
If I hear anything , I 'll let you know .

461
00:37:06,516 --> 00:37:07,434
No , wait !

462
00:37:08,977 --> 00:37:09,811
Go away !

463
00:37:09,811 --> 00:37:12,147
I haven 't got time for the living .

464
00:37:51,311 --> 00:37:52,145
Gnaghi ?

465
00:38:37,649 --> 00:38:38,483
Gnaghi !

466
00:38:39,484 --> 00:38:43,488
Gnaghi , they came back sooner than we thought !

467
00:38:43,488 --> 00:38:44,781
Gnaghi , wake up !

468
00:39:04,176 --> 00:39:05,969
Gnaghi , watch out !

469
00:40:10,325 --> 00:40:12,160
Oh , Gnaghi , I 'm sorry !

470
00:40:13,328 --> 00:40:14,746
I didn 't mean to .

471
00:40:24,631 --> 00:40:25,465
Right !

472
00:40:25,465 --> 00:40:26,299
That 's it .

473
00:40:26,299 --> 00:40:27,134
Time 's up and ,

474
00:40:27,134 --> 00:40:29,261
I want you upstairs , and ready in five minutes , okay ?

475
00:41:42,542 --> 00:41:43,376
Oh , no !

476
00:41:43,376 --> 00:41:45,212
What 's she doing here ?

477
00:41:57,307 --> 00:41:58,183
Hey !

478
00:41:58,183 --> 00:41:59,351
Visiting hours are over !

479
00:41:59,351 --> 00:42:00,393
No !

480
00:42:00,393 --> 00:42:02,562
You 're gonna take me away from him !

481
00:42:05,106 --> 00:42:05,941
Quick !

482
00:42:05,941 --> 00:42:07,692
Get the fuck over here , quick !

483
00:42:07,692 --> 00:42:08,527
No !

484
00:42:08,527 --> 00:42:09,361
Claudio !

485
00:42:09,361 --> 00:42:10,195
No !

486
00:42:40,267 --> 00:42:41,101
No !

487
00:42:50,193 --> 00:42:51,820
No , Claudio !

488
00:42:51,820 --> 00:42:53,238
Take me with you !

489
00:42:55,532 --> 00:42:56,408
Darn !

490
00:42:56,408 --> 00:42:57,325
Stupid cow !

491
00:43:02,163 --> 00:43:02,998
Come on !

492
00:43:08,837 --> 00:43:10,088
Please , wait !

493
00:43:14,384 --> 00:43:16,928
Claudio , please , take me with you !

494
00:43:16,928 --> 00:43:19,014
Tell me you only love me !

495
00:43:21,641 --> 00:43:22,434
Please !

496
00:43:39,326 --> 00:43:40,160
Claudio ?

497
00:43:42,495 --> 00:43:44,497
You only love me , right ?

498
00:44:06,144 --> 00:44:07,020
Hey .

499
00:44:10,690 --> 00:44:11,524
Damn !

500
00:44:11,524 --> 00:44:15,028
Always shoots to the right when it 's cold .

501
00:44:36,841 --> 00:44:37,676
Gnaghi !

502
00:45:17,173 --> 00:45:18,800
No , please don 't !

503
00:45:18,800 --> 00:45:21,052
He 's only eating me !

504
00:45:21,052 --> 00:45:22,303
Move aside .

505
00:45:22,303 --> 00:45:23,346
Mind your own business .

506
00:45:23,346 --> 00:45:25,223
I can be eaten by whoever I please !

507
00:45:25,223 --> 00:45:26,683
This is my business .

508
00:45:26,683 --> 00:45:28,184
They pay me for it .

509
00:45:41,906 --> 00:45:46,578
The living dead and the dying living are all the same .

510
00:45:46,578 --> 00:45:48,663
Cut from the same cloth .

511
00:45:49,956 --> 00:45:53,334
But disposing of dead people is a public service .

512
00:45:53,334 --> 00:45:55,545
Whereas you 're in all sorts of trouble

513
00:45:55,545 --> 00:45:58,047
if you kill someone when they 're still alive .

514
00:46:09,684 --> 00:46:10,518
Wait !

515
00:46:28,369 --> 00:46:31,164
This way they 'll be together forever .

516
00:46:35,752 --> 00:46:38,588
I 'm sentimental !

517
00:46:59,984 --> 00:47:01,986
Patience , Gnaghi .

518
00:47:01,986 --> 00:47:05,907
In love , it 's the waiting that 's the best part .

519
00:47:05,907 --> 00:47:08,409
You have to learn how to wait .

520
00:48:26,779 --> 00:48:28,698
What 's your name again ?

521
00:48:28,698 --> 00:48:30,116
Gna .

522
00:48:30,116 --> 00:48:30,950
Gnaghi .

523
00:48:36,539 --> 00:48:37,874
