524
00:48:39,375 --> 00:48:41,085
Haven 't I seen you before ?

525
00:48:41,085 --> 00:48:43,379
Mm-hmm .

526
00:48:43,379 --> 00:48:44,464
Oh , yeah .

527
00:48:44,464 --> 00:48:46,424
Now I remember .

528
00:48:46,424 --> 00:48:48,134
You threw up on me .

529
00:48:48,134 --> 00:48:49,344
How sweet !

530
00:48:57,226 --> 00:48:58,811
But I like shy boys .

531
00:48:59,854 --> 00:49:02,565
And you never say no to a kiss .

532
00:49:02,565 --> 00:49:04,484
Take advantage .

533
00:49:04,484 --> 00:49:06,945
I 'm certainly in no position to refuse .

534
00:49:06,945 --> 00:49:10,323
Besides , I don 't think I 'd refuse anyway .

535
00:49:10,323 --> 00:49:11,157
Hmm ?

536
00:50:23,521 --> 00:50:24,689
False alarm !

537
00:50:25,732 --> 00:50:27,233
It was only a cat .

538
00:50:35,783 --> 00:50:37,952
No use you trying to help me , little thing !

539
00:50:39,662 --> 00:50:41,164
If I can 't do it , imagine you !

540
00:50:42,582 --> 00:50:44,292
Putting this skull together

541
00:50:45,835 --> 00:50:48,296
