542
00:51:23,623 --> 00:51:26,876
You know , you really are disgusting when you eat , Gnaghi !

543
00:51:26,918 --> 00:51:27,710
Nyah .

544
00:51:28,669 --> 00:51:30,171
Yes , you 're right .

545
00:51:30,171 --> 00:51:31,881
I suppose it all does get mixed up

546
00:51:31,881 --> 00:51:33,174
