547
00:51:37,345 --> 00:51:38,179
What is it ?

548
00:52:17,260 --> 00:52:18,761
That wasn 't a cat .

549
00:54:04,367 --> 00:54:05,201
We can 't !

550
00:54:05,201 --> 00:54:06,035
I 'm alive .

551
00:54:09,413 --> 00:54:11,332
And you 're dead .

552
00:54:11,332 --> 00:54:13,834
I 'm not prejudiced , my love .

553
00:55:39,628 --> 00:55:40,713
I killed her .

554
00:55:42,423 --> 00:55:43,257
Nyah .

555
00:55:48,387 --> 00:55:49,638
I killed her !

556
00:55:58,564 --> 00:56:00,274
I killed her .

