01:33:37,446 --> 01:33:40,949
Dellamorte Dellamore bids you farewell

1104
01:33:42,951 --> 01:33:44,578
and he 's on his way .

1105
01:33:46,288 --> 01:33:47,247
Where to ?

1106
01:33:52,294 --> 01:33:54,129
Better get out of here .

1107
01:33:55,547 --> 01:33:57,049
Even the statues are talking .

1108
01:33:59,968 --> 01:34:01,970
Where do you think you 're going ,

1109
01:34:01,970 --> 01:34:04,723
if you haven 't yet understood the difference

1110
01:34:04,723 --> 01:34:06,767
between life and me ?

1111
01:34:20,364 --> 01:34:22,699
Gnaghi , you 're not bringing that .

1112
01:34:25,327 --> 01:34:26,161
Nyah !

1113
01:34:28,372 --> 01:34:31,375
That coffin is not coming with us .

1114
01:35:06,493 --> 01:35:07,828
Nyah !

1115
01:35:07,828 --> 01:35:08,662
Yeah , I missed that one .

1116
01:35:08,662 --> 01:35:09,788
Don 't worry , I 'll get the next one .

1117
01:35:09,788 --> 01:35:10,664
Nyah !

1118
01:35:10,664 --> 01:35:13,667
Oh calm down , I know every bump on this road !

1119
01:35:16,712 --> 01:35:21,717
There 's one .

1120
01:35:22,134 --> 01:35:22,968
Look !

1121
01:35:25,387 --> 01:35:27,472
I 've never been this far .

1122
01:35:29,766 --> 01:35:32,269
We made it , Gnaghi !

1123
01:35:36,440 --> 01:35:38,108
Who could 've imagined this ?

1124
01:35:38,108 --> 01:35:40,777
Wider than all the streets of Buffalora put together .

1125
01:35:42,112 --> 01:35:43,947
It never seems to end .

1126
01:35:43,947 --> 01:35:45,282
Nyah .

1127
01:35:47,117 --> 01:35:48,201
Hang on , Gnaghi .

1128
01:35:49,369 --> 01:35:52,247
Past this tunnel is the rest of the world !

1129
01:36:01,715 --> 01:36:05,302
What do you think the rest of the world looks like , Gnaghi ?

1130
01:36:05,302 --> 01:36:06,136
Can you imagine ?

1131
01:36:11,975 --> 01:36:12,893
You 're right .

1132
01:36:12,893 --> 01:36:14,478
It 's beyond imagination .

1133
01:37:08,281 --> 01:37:10,200
I should have known it .

1134
01:37:12,786 --> 01:37:15,330
The rest of the world doesn 't exist !

1135
01:37:26,383 --> 01:37:27,217
Gnaghi !

1136
01:37:28,844 --> 01:37:31,012
Gnaghi , you weren 't hit that hard , come on !

1137
01:37:31,012 --> 01:37:32,597
I 'll take you to the car .

1138
01:37:32,597 --> 01:37:33,598
Come on !

1139
01:37:33,598 --> 01:37:34,432
Gnaghi !

1140
01:37:34,432 --> 01:37:35,267
Why are you going on like this ?

1141
01:37:35,267 --> 01:37:36,101
You just got cut , come on , man !

1142
01:37:36,101 --> 01:37:37,185
Get up , I 'll take you to the car .

1143
01:37:37,185 --> 01:37:38,812
Come on , man !

1144
01:37:38,812 --> 01:37:39,729
Get up .

1145
01:37:39,729 --> 01:37:43,024
What ?

1146
01:37:43,024 --> 01:37:43,859
Gnaghi !

1147
01:37:47,696 --> 01:37:48,530
Gnaghi !

1148
01:37:49,823 --> 01:37:51,992
Don 't leave me alone , now !

1149
01:37:51,992 --> 01:37:53,785
Gnaghi !

1150
01:37:57,163 --> 01:37:57,998
Oh , God !

1151
01:37:59,624 --> 01:38:03,587
Death , Death , Death comes sweeping down .

1152
01:38:04,504 --> 01:38:07,173
Filthy Death , the leering clown ,

1153
01:38:07,173 --> 01:38:10,260
Death on wings , Death by surprise .

1154
01:38:10,260 --> 01:38:13,096
Veiling evil from worldly eyes .

1155
01:38:13,096 --> 01:38:16,057
Death that 's born as Life succumbs ,

1156
01:38:16,057 --> 01:38:18,685
while Death and Love , two kindred drums ,

1157
01:38:18,685 --> 01:38:21,646
beat the time till Judgment Day .

1158
01:38:21,646 --> 01:38:23,857
An actor in a passion play ,

1159
01:38:23,857 --> 01:38:27,068
without beginning , without end .

1160
01:38:27,068 --> 01:38:29,070
Evermore , amen .

1161
01:38:55,847 --> 01:38:57,682
You were my best friend .

1162
01:39:01,102 --> 01:39:02,354
I didn 't even realize it .

1163
01:39:54,406 --> 01:39:56,366
Could you take me home , please ?

1164
01:40:02,372 --> 01:40:03,206
Nyah !

